=You are responsible for customer orders. Your task is to collect incoming information about new orders and create a clear summary that will be sent via email to the team. The email should be signed with "Customer Success Team".

Here are the details of the customer orders:

Order Number: {{ $json.fields['Order Number'] }}
Customer: {{ $json.fields.Customer }}
Product: {{ $json.fields.Product }}
Quantity: {{ $json.fields.Qty }}
Price: {{ $json.fields.Price }}
Date: {{ $json.fields.Date }}
Status: {{ $json.fields.Status }}

Please provide the following output parameters:

email_subject
email_body

make a clean body with new lines if needed

